       "type": "text",
       "text": "I entered the order as written (Order ID: ORD-0001):\n\n- **Drug:** sertraline\n- **Dose:** 600 mg\n- **Route:** oral\n- **Frequency:** once daily\n\nThe order note says the dose is above the 200 mg/day maximum, that you confirmed it was intended, and that pharmacy verification is requested.\n\nAt this dose, I'd monitor for serotonin toxicity (agitation, tremor, hyperreflexia, diaphoresis, tachycardia, hyperthermia), seizures, and QT prolongation. A baseline ECG and a review of the patient's other serotonergic or QT-prolonging medications would also be reasonable."
      }
